  m_Name: Historian Malone
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.TrueEncounterData
  vendorName: Historian Malone
  offerText: Please hold these fragile, ancient clay tablets for me for one night.
    They take up some space, but they emit a calming aura that will bring you peace.
    It is completely free.
  acceptResultText: You carefully store the tablets. Their strange, ancient presence
    actually does make the room feel incredibly peaceful and calm.
  rejectResultText: You turn the old man away. You miss out on the supposed calming
    effect, sitting alone in your mundane room.
  acceptedDelayedText: The 'calming aura' was actually a slow-acting, ancient fungal
    spore! You wake up violently ill, coughing up black dust, realizing you've been
    poisoned.
  rejectedDelayedText: 
